# Trial by Ice (battlefield.trial_by_ice): the requirement arms. Main, a level 75 Warrior with the quest accepted but no
# Tuning Fork of Ice: IP_Entrance: the key item check fails: no options: the default. bob, with the fork but the quest
# only available: BattlefieldQuest's check (accepted or more) fails: the default.
lists CloisterOfFrost/IP_Entrance/onTrigger
char zone=CloisterOfFrost pos=558.5,-0.8,600.0 job=WAR lvl=75
char bob zone=CloisterOfFrost pos=558.5,-0.8,600.0 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Sandoria.TrialByIce accepted
bob: keyitem TuningForkOfIce
login
trigger IP_Entrance                     # accepted, no fork: no options
bob: login
bob: trigger IP_Entrance                # the fork, available: no options
